== Branding
folio supports multiple visual styles through a theme-driven system. You can choose from built-in presets (e.g., `corporate`, `academic`) or provide your own brand dictionary to customize colors, fonts, and geometry. 

See `docs/styling.md` for the full reference on presets and available tokens.
